# Walkthrough - Prompt 1.3: Backend Auth Logic & Government Approval APIs

Successfully implemented the complete Phase 1 authentication and verification backend infrastructure, including Patient auth, Hospital Admin registration with approval gating, and Government Employee approval workflows.

## Changes Completed

### 1. Security & Middleware
- **[src/utils/generateToken.js](file:///d:/SAHAY0.1/backend/src/utils/generateToken.js)**:
  - Generates signed JWT tokens with `{ id, role }` and 30-day expiry using `process.env.JWT_SECRET`.
- **[src/middlewares/authMiddleware.js](file:///d:/SAHAY0.1/backend/src/middlewares/authMiddleware.js)**:
  - `protect`: Extracts Bearer token, verifies JWT, attaches `req.user` (omitting password hash).
  - `authorize(...roles)`: RBAC middleware restricting access based on user role (e.g. `GovtEmployee`).

### 2. Patient Authentication
- **[src/controllers/patientController.js](file:///d:/SAHAY0.1/backend/src/controllers/patientController.js)** & **[src/routes/patientRoutes.js](file:///d:/SAHAY0.1/backend/src/routes/patientRoutes.js)**:
  - `POST /api/patients/register`: Validates input, prevents duplicates, creates user with `role: 'Patient'`, returns JWT token.
  - `POST /api/patients/login`: Validates credentials, checks password hash, returns JWT token.

### 3. Hospital Admin Authentication & Verification Lock
- **[src/controllers/hospitalAuthController.js](file:///d:/SAHAY0.1/backend/src/controllers/hospitalAuthController.js)** & **[src/routes/hospitalAuthRoutes.js](file:///d:/SAHAY0.1/backend/src/routes/hospitalAuthRoutes.js)**:
  - `POST /api/hospital-auth/register`:
    - Checks for existing hospital registration number and admin email.
    - Creates `Hospital` document with `verificationStatus: 'pending'`.
    - Creates `User` document with `role: 'HospitalAdmin'` referenced to `hospitalId`.
  - `POST /api/hospital-auth/login`:
    - Verifies credentials.
    - Inspects associated hospital's `verificationStatus`.
    - **Denies access (403 Forbidden)** if status is `'pending'` or `'rejected'`.
    - Grants access (200 OK with JWT token) only once `'approved'`.

### 4. Government Employee Actions
- **[src/controllers/govtController.js](file:///d:/SAHAY0.1/backend/src/controllers/govtController.js)** & **[src/routes/govtRoutes.js](file:///d:/SAHAY0.1/backend/src/routes/govtRoutes.js)**:
  - `POST /api/govt/login` & `POST /api/govt/register`: Government employee authentication.
  - `GET /api/govt/pending-hospitals`: Protected route (`protect`, `authorize('GovtEmployee')`) retrieving all unverified hospitals awaiting approval.
  - `PUT /api/govt/verify-hospital/:id`: Protected route allowing government staff to update status to `'approved'` or `'rejected'`.

### 5. Server Mounts
- **[server.js](file:///d:/SAHAY0.1/backend/server.js)**:
  - Mounted `/api/patients` -> `patientRoutes`
  - Mounted `/api/hospital-auth` -> `hospitalAuthRoutes`
  - Mounted `/api/govt` -> `govtRoutes`

